// Okta New Admin Console Behaviours | T1078.004 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/identity/okta/okta_new_behaviours_admin_console.yml
(eventType:policy.evaluate_sign_on AND target.displayName:"Okta Admin Console") AND (debugContext.debugData.behaviors:*POSITIVE* OR debugContext.debugData.logOnlySecurityData:*POSITIVE*)

// Stellar Cyber Query Builder (DSL):
{
  "query": {
